# `En1996Mutation` op frame (`semio_s_artifact_norm_contract::payload_op_binary`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`), then
# `tag u8`, then the leaf payload (`Mutation::payload_value`) as canonical UTF-8 JSON to the end of the op. Each record is
# one mutation kind — the leaf descriptor's `semanticKind` at its `binaryTag` — and this file is the only source of the tags.
